ebook to set up instant first replies, after-hours coverage and follow-up on your Facebook Page in one evening. ₱299."},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(85,85,85,1)","fontSize":21,"fontWeight":"400","height":98,"left":160,"lineHeight":"1.5","textAlign":"left","top":277,"width":640}},"mobile":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(85,85,85,1)","fontSize":18,"fontWeight":"400","height":112,"left":20,"lineHeight":"1.5","textAlign":"left","top":245,"width":380}}}},{"id":"t_2112","type":"text-block","specials":{"text":"By <a href=\"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home\" style=\"color:rgba(0,122,102,1);text-decoration:underline\">Dijae Dadula</a> · 23-page PDF · ₱299"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(120,120,120,1)","fontSize":14,"fontWeight":"400","height":25,"left":160,"lineHeight":"1.5","textAlign":"left","top":393,"width":640}},"mobile":{"styles":{"color":"rgba(120,120,120,1)","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"400","height":24,"left":20,"lineHeight":"1.5","textAlign":"left","top":371,"width":380}}}},{"id":"eb_2120","type":"editor-blog","specials":{"html":"<div class='dd-article'>\n<figure class='dd-fig'><div class='dd-shot' style='aspect-ratio:16/9'><img src='https://statics.pancake.vn/web-media-264/a6/bb/b9/08/54e4bbfdfaa938cc1fde64c3145a356a29c8b079884067c1c3e88fc4-w:1536-h:864-l:71175-t:image/jpeg.jpg' alt='Ebook cover of The 60-Minute Messenger Fix by Dijae Dadula in teal, beside two chat bubbles showing a customer question and an instant reply' width='1536' height='864' loading='lazy'></div></figure>\n<div class='dd-tldr'>\n<p class='dd-tldr-title'>What you get for ₱299</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A <b>23-page PDF</b> guide you can finish in one evening.</li>\n<li><b>Eight short chapters</b>, each ending with a “You're done when” checklist.</li>\n<li><b>Copy-paste scripts</b> for greeting, price, availability, order and handoff messages.</li>\n<li>A <b>10-message test</b>, a <b>7-day tracker</b> and a <b>results card</b> to measure your own before and after.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style='text-align:center;margin:26px 0 8px'><a href='https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/PLB-FUFSL87BU33U' rel='noopener' style='display:inline-block;background:#c2410c;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none'>Get the ebook for ₱299</a></p>\n<p style='text-align:center;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 24px'>Secure checkout through PayPal (card or PayPal balance). The PDF is sent to your PayPal email within 24 hours.</p>\n<h2 id='problem'>The problem this fixes</h2>\n<p>A buyer messages your Facebook Page at 10 PM. Nobody answers until morning. By then they have asked two other sellers. Slow first replies quietly cost small businesses sales every day, and most owners never measure it.</p>\n<p>This guide walks you through a simple reply system for your Page: an instant first reply, after-hours coverage, answers to the questions you get every day, gentle follow-up, and a clean handoff to you when a real person is needed.</p>\n<h2 id='inside'>What's inside</h2>\n<div class='dd-table-wrap'><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Chapter</th><th>What you do</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>1. Baseline</td><td>Measure how long buyers wait for a first reply today. This is your “before”.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2. The free layer</td><td>Turn on Meta's built-in instant reply and away message.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3. The five messages</td><td>Copy-paste scripts for greeting, price, availability, order and handoff.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4. Botcake setup</td><td>Connect your Page, then add a welcome message, default reply, keywords and a main menu.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>5. After hours and the 24-hour rule</td><td>What you can and can't send, in plain terms.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>6. Follow-up</td><td>Two polite nudges for people who go quiet.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>7. Handoff and fixes</td><td>When the bot stops and you take over, plus a fix table for common problems.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>8. Test and prove it</td><td>A 10-message test, a 7-day tracker and a results card you can share.</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<h2 id='who'>Who it's for</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Online sellers, shops and service businesses that get inquiries on a Facebook Page.</li>\n<li>Owners who answer messages themselves and can't be online all day.</li>\n<li>Anyone who wants a working setup tonight, without hiring a developer.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>It's not for you if you need an AI chatbot trained on your product catalog, Instagram or WhatsApp automation, or payment collection inside chat. Those are covered in my blog and in done-for-you work.</p>\n<div class='dd-note'><span class='dd-note-label'>Dijae's rule</span><p>A result you can screenshot beats a promise you can only describe. That's why every chapter ends with a check you can see on your own Page.</p></div>\n<h2 id='done'>How you'll know it worked</h2>\n<div class='dd-table-wrap'><table>\n<thead><tr><th>Test</th><th>Pass when</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Message your Page from a second account</td><td>An instant reply arrives within seconds</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Send “price” or “available”</td><td>The matching answer comes back</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Ask to talk to a person</td><td>The bot hands off and you get notified</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Track 7 days</td><td>Your results card shows your before and after reply times</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>An honest limitation: this guide gets your replies fast and consistent, but it can't promise more sales. Results depend on your offer, your prices and how many messages you get. Platform menus and rules also change, so the book tells you where to double-check before you rely on a setting.</p>\n<h2 id='author'>About the author</h2>\n<p>I'm Dijae Dadula. I've built chatbots and Messenger automation since 2017: ChatFuel community moderator in 2018, official pioneer educator for Pancake and Botcake in 2019, and ManyChat Partner Agency in 2020. This guide is the setup I'd walk a small business through in its first evening.</p>\n<p style='text-align:center;margin:26px 0 8px'><a href='https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/PLB-FUFSL87BU33U' rel='noopener' style='display:inline-block;background:#c2410c;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none'>Get the ebook for ₱299</a></p>\n<p style='text-align:center;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 24px'>One-time payment. Digital PDF, no shipping.</p>\n<h2 id='faq'>Frequently asked questions</h2>\n<h3>How do I receive the ebook?</h3>\n<p>After you pay through PayPal, the PDF is sent to the email on your PayPal account within 24 hours.</p>\n<h3>Do I need to pay for Botcake?</h3>\n<p>No. Chapter 2 uses Meta's free tools, and Botcake can be started on its free tier. Check Botcake's current plans before you upgrade.</p>\n<h3>Can I pay with GCash or Maya?</h3>\n<p>Checkout is through PayPal for now, which accepts cards and PayPal balance. For other payment options, email hello@dijaedadula.com.</p>\n<h3>I have a question before buying.</h3>\n<p>Email hello@dijaedadula.com and I'll answer.</p>\n<p style='font-size:14px'>Disclosure: the guide includes my affiliate link to Botcake (<a href='https://www.dijaedadula.com/botcake' rel='sponsored nofollow'>www.dijaedadula.com/botcake</a>). If you sign up through it, I may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.</p>\n<div class='dd-cta'><b>Not ready to buy?</b> Get one practical AI idea every week in the free newsletter: <a href='https://grow.dijaedadula.com/newsletter' rel='noopener'>Subscribe</a>.</div>\n</div>\n"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"styles":{"height":3833,"left":160,"top":450,"width":640}},"mobile":{"styles":{"height":4767,"left":20,"top":423,"width":380}}}},{"id":"h_css2121","type":"html-box","specials":{"html":"&lt;style&gt;.dd-article ul{list-style:disc outside !important}.dd-article ol{list-style:decimal outside !important}.dd-article li{display:list-item !important}.dd-article ul ul{list-style:circle outside !important}&lt;/style&gt;"},"responsive":{"desktop":{"sty